{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51009","headline":"颂裴长史歌（题拟） · 无名氏","name":"颂裴长史歌（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宾朋何喧喧？日夜裴公门。\n愿得裴公之一言，不须驱马埒华轩。\n（按李白《上安没裴长史书》有云：「故时人歌曰〖歌不重录〗。\n白不知君侯何以得此声于天壤之间。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51009.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51009","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}